[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0010","text":"制作人！\n你有在看吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0020","text":"嗯，一直在好好看着呢。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0030","text":"非常棒。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0040","text":"你真的让非常美丽的花朵盛开了。\n谢谢你，甘奈。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0050","text":"……！\n……嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0060","text":"制作人……\n甘奈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0070","text":"从今以后……\n要开好多……好多好多"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0080","text":"美丽的花朵……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0090","text":"嗯，为了那个目标\n我们一起努力吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21400100_03_0100","text":"嗯……！\n今后也请多多关照……！"}]
